abstract: A deterministic, point-weighted benchmark toolkit for Chinese Gaokao questions. Engine 0.1.0 separates a subject-neutral harness from versioned benchmark specifications and immutable data packages, with scoped metrics, reproducible provider protocols, resume support, and audited text/vision slices. The companion 0.0.1 dataset contains 74 choice and fill-in mathematics questions from five 2025 papers; its legacy adapter remains reproducible. The dataset is distributed separately; exam material is not part of the software artifact and is not relicensed by these terms.

